(property "Design Notes" "normal-voltage supply; local decoupling per Nordic config3 | USB/VREGH unused; Nordic CMAA config3 | Nordic CMAA config3; DECR and DECRF intentionally share a decoupling node | USB unused: grounded as Nordic CMAA config3 | Tied VDD in normal-voltage mode; VREGH disabled automatically | Unused GPIO; disable input and pulls; LFRC calibrated; NFC disabled for G11/H12 | nRESET has internal pull-up | I2S SDOUT; PSEL assignment; GPIO input disconnected when unused | I2S SDIN; PSEL assignment; GPIO input disconnected when unused | amplifier enable/select control; PSEL assignment; GPIO input disconnected when unused; local U10_SD_BUF SPDT selects GND or 1V8_SYS | UARTE TXD; PSEL assignment; GPIO input disconnected when unused | I2S LRCK; PSEL assignment; GPIO input disconnected when unused | I2S SCK; PSEL assignment; GPIO input disconnected when unused | UARTE RXD; enable pull-up; PSEL assignment; GPIO input disconnected when unused" (at 76.2 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9)) (hide yes)))
